<%#
# Key: tools/validation/schema/minimum
# Purpose: Schema numeric minimum feedback.
# Used: Returned to the model when LittleGhost produces schema numeric minimum feedback.
# Locals:
# - path: Path or validation location referenced by the prompt.
# - minimum: Configured minimum required by validation.
# Constraints:
# - Must render non-blank.
-%>
<%= path %> must be at least <%= minimum %>
